# Hoogle MCP server development guide

In this file, "you" means Cursor, and "I" means the programmer.

## Project management

This project is managed by `hatch`. Installing dependencies must be done in its environment.

## Validation

You must read the CI configuration file, and make sure all the checks pass on the local machine too once you have modified something. You can finish your editing or proceed to next once the checks succeed.
